{"hw":"Παλαμήδης","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">Παλαμήδης</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Παλαμήδης</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, voc. <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ες</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1451</span> </span>; gen. <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ους</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Or.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">433</span> </span>, etc.; dat. <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ει</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">41b</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">εϊ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Q.S.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.198</span> </span>; acc. <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">η</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ep.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">311b</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">εα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">198</span> </span> (lyr.); but some forms occur of <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1</span> </span> decl., dat. <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ῃ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> s.v. ἄκεστρον; acc. <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ην</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phdr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">261d</span> </span>: (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">παλάμη</span>):—<cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Palamedes</cite>, i.e. <b class=\"lex-tr\">the Inventor</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">770</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1451</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Paus.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.20.3</span> </span>:—hence <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adj.</span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Παλαμήδειος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">α</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">worthy of Palamedes, ingenious</b>, <span class=\"gk\">βούλευμα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Alciphr.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.4</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀβάκιον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">EM</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">666.21</span> </span>; also <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Παλαμηδικός</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ή</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">όν</span> <span class=\"gk\">, Π. τοὐξεύρημα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eup.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">351.6</span> </span>.</div></div>"}